'''Featherdrop''' is a spell used to slow down fast falling objects by creating a yellow or red bubble of energy.

== History ==
[[Lok Lambert]] learned this spell from [[Dante Vale]] and used it when jumping from the upper levels of the [[Basilisk House]]. {{Source|Absent Heroes}}

After using [[Hyperstride]] to jump over a skycraper, Lok and [[Sophie Casterwill]] used Featherdrop to quickly drop down and escape two [[Silent Soldiers]]. The spell was used unusually to accelerate the fall, instead of slowing it down. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}

Lok and [[Den Fears]] used Featherdrop while jumping out of a plane on motorbikes. {{source|The Power of Umbra}}

[[Scarlet Byrne]] and [[Sandra Lambert]] used the spell when jumping out of a [[Scramjet]] to join the fight against the [[Blood Spiral]] at the [[Spiral Mark]]. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

{{Clear}}
